<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-REUTER OF DORTMUND SENT OFF AGAINST AUXERRE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-REUTER OF DORTMUND SENT OFF AGAINST AUXERRE.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stefan Reuter of Borussia Dortmund was sent off in the 87th minute of a European Cup quarter-final first leg match against Auxerre on Wednesday for a second bookable offence.</p>
</text>
